# Windows-only project: every text file is checked out with CRLF on every machine (Windows and
# Linux alike), and stored as LF inside the repository. This keeps files from showing as fully
# modified when the project moves between operating systems.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Translation review sheets hold both CRLF (row ends, some keys) and bare LF (inside cells, other
# keys). The line endings are data that LangTool matches on, so git must not convert them.
docs/translations/*.csv -text

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
